    (h2 : ∀ k1 k2 k3, ‖W k1 k2 k3‖ ≤ A2 k1 k2 k3)
    (h3 : ∀ k1 k2 k3, ‖W k1 k2 k3‖ ≤ A3 k1 k2 k3)
    (ht0 : 0 ≤ t0) (ht1 : 0 ≤ t1) (ht2 : 0 ≤ t2) (ht3 : 0 ≤ t3)
    (hsum : t0 + t1 + t2 + t3 = 1) :
    ‖∑ k1 ∈ S1, ∑ k2 ∈ S2, ∑ k3 ∈ S3, W k1 k2 k3‖ ≤
      ∑ k1 ∈ S1, ∑ k2 ∈ S2, ∑ k3 ∈ S3,
